{
  "title": "Lightly Simmered Irish Semolina Pilaf",
  "description": "A tangy and juicy Irish dish featuring semolina, perfect for the monsoon season, this low-calorie-friendly pilaf is a great option for a weeknight dinner. It combines the creaminess of semolina with the freshness of herbs and the zing of citrus.",
