  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the semolina and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the water, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15-20 minutes, or until the semolina is cooked and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "Serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley if desired."
